    "short_description": "An easy to start programming puzzle game where you design Artificial Intelligence with symbols, to control robot cubes and build space pyramids. Inspired by SpaceChem, Lightbot, Human Resource Machine and the Redstone from Minecraft. A game 99% made by one guy.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French",
    "reviews": "\u201cLooks like a neat programming puzzle game about self-replicating machines.\u201d<br>Zachtronics (SpaceChem, Opus Magnum, Shenzhen I/O, TIS-100, Infinifactory, Exapunks)<br><br>\u201cThe very smart God is a Cube, able to teach programming basics and provide fun - at the same time.\u201d<br>Le Monde<br><br>\u201cThis is a good project, and a pretty brain teaser, it's incredible !\u201d<br>MisterMV<br>",
